                        "glosses": [
                            "расположенный под прямым углом, перпендикулярный"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "16d23d97-24e7-462c-92e0-579a6c29846e",
                                "sense_id": "2833c51f-5b10-3892-bb8c-b741f0a5fb2a",
                                "text": "Ортогональная система координат."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7e2eacc2-07f1-4851-b895-419877cdac2f",
                        "source_entry_id": "cdd7984c-a1d4-35af-87c9-8847d97ee18e",
                        "source_sense_id": "2833c51f-5b10-3892-bb8c-b741f0a5fb2a",
                        "target_lang_word": "orthogonal",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "orthogonal",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3d9c51c4-9c53-34ba-8852-82b5e2625223",
                                        "entry_id": "c904890f-0d77-3593-88b5-addf8598fe97",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of two objects, at right angles; perpendicular to each other."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1b1dea38-9346-4220-94b4-b84310d43914",
                                                "sense_id": "3d9c51c4-9c53-34ba-8852-82b5e2625223",
                                                "text": "A chord and the radius that bisects it are orthogonal."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dd09c845-379b-3eed-bece-24d2791235e2",
                                        "entry_id": "c904890f-0d77-3593-88b5-addf8598fe97",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of a pair of vectors: having a zero inner product; perpendicular."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f29d366c-d3f2-41af-adaa-4b7f30348d22",
                                                "sense_id": "dd09c845-379b-3eed-bece-24d2791235e2",
                                                "text": "The normal vector and tangent vector at a given point are orthogonal."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fb1bca2d-962f-38dc-b342-99ddbb363588",
                                        "entry_id": "c904890f-0d77-3593-88b5-addf8598fe97",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of a square matrix: such that its transpose is equal to its inverse."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "212a7ae4-e111-38ff-b834-bc660bcad2ee",
                                        "entry_id": "c904890f-0d77-3593-88b5-addf8598fe97",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of a linear transformation: preserving its angles."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "82d2ecf8-f2a7-3ba8-8536-f00fa7ddd682",
                                        "entry_id": "c904890f-0d77-3593-88b5-addf8598fe97",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of grid graphs, board games and polyominoes: vertical or horizontal but not diagonal."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9e612708-5b5b-3e1e-9ea1-cba5eb6ec90d",
                                        "entry_id": "c904890f-0d77-3593-88b5-addf8598fe97",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of a pair of elements in an ortholattice: each less than or equal to the orthocomplement of the other."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7c496472-0efa-3a6d-954d-42076236b72f",
                                        "entry_id": "c904890f-0d77-3593-88b5-addf8598fe97",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Statistically independent, with reference to variates."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5017160c-67bf-3f99-bbfb-33ac734921a2",
                                        "entry_id": "c904890f-0d77-3593-88b5-addf8598fe97",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of two or more aspects of a problem, able to be treated separately; of a design, exhibiting consistency and composability."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f03747bd-fc2c-43ee-bb85-91a8a9ad39c0",
                                                "sense_id": "5017160c-67bf-3f99-bbfb-33ac734921a2",
                                                "text": "The content of the message should be orthogonal to the means of its delivery."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e8f45968-af3a-4573-ade3-d447e33ffb07",
                                                "sense_id": "5017160c-67bf-3f99-bbfb-33ac734921a2",
                                                "text": "An orthogonal approach also promotes reuse. If components have specific, well-defined responsibilities, they can be combined with new components in ways that were not envisioned by their original implementors."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4f2505ea-a2cc-35cb-8f87-2f35d94e799d",
                                        "entry_id": "c904890f-0d77-3593-88b5-addf8598fe97",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of two or more problems or subjects, independent of or irrelevant to each other."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "13804789-05b8-4218-9f19-3667c6fce68f",
                                                "sense_id": "4f2505ea-a2cc-35cb-8f87-2f35d94e799d",
                                                "text": "Even in a geostate, some people are willing to fight and die for their views, but the institutional change to a polystate seems somewhat orthogonal to such issues."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "orthogonal",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a085694d-0d58-314d-a314-82bd4e98d99e",
                                        "entry_id": "ab1c9e41-8f3e-30d0-bde8-b856b12c7021",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An orthogonal line."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ccd6de68-763f-4fd6-b608-6ebf0a9bf8d9",
                                                "sense_id": "a085694d-0d58-314d-a314-82bd4e98d99e",
                                                "text": "All of the orthogonals in this painting display an understanding of linear perspective."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
